# Phase 7.5: Architecture & UI Alignment

This intermediate phase implements critical pre-Phase 8 refinements based on your feedback. We are adjusting the UI terminology for enterprise-ready clarity and updating the backend contract to be "Source Aware," preparing for the pluggable adapter pattern in Phase 8A.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Source Type Persistence**: I will update the `/upload` endpoint and `session_store` to track `old_source_type` and `new_source_type`. For V1, these will default to `sql_dump`, but this change establishes the permanent contract needed for Phase 8.
>
> **Phase 8 Split**: Per your suggestion, I've updated the roadmap to split Phase 8 into 8A (Architecture & Adapters) and 8B (Real Implementation).

